# 前端镜像（apps/web/Dockerfile）专用的构建上下文白名单：默认什么都不进，只放行构建前端需要的文件。
# 根目录的 .dockerignore 是给 API 镜像用的；BuildKit 发现这个文件时用它代替根目录那份。
*

!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!tsconfig.json
!packages/
packages/*
!packages/config/
packages/config/*
!packages/config/package.json
!packages/domain/
!apps/
apps/*
!apps/api/
apps/api/*
!apps/api/package.json
!apps/web/
apps/web/Dockerfile
apps/web/Dockerfile.dockerignore
apps/web/dist
apps/web/e2e
apps/web/test
apps/web/playwright.config.ts
apps/web/playwright-report
apps/web/test-results
!docs/
docs/*
!docs/design/
docs/design/*
!docs/design/tokens.css

# 放行的目录里再排除：依赖、测试、任何 .env
**/node_modules
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
**/*.itest.ts
apps/web/src/testing
**/.env
**/.env.*
